From e74d768032fe29293c75db304b21ef69a98c4e84 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: phoenix port <fix@me>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 09:16:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/13] arm64: dts: qcom: phoenix device support (consolidated
 DTS)

Base phoenix device tree plus typec/PD sink PDOs (5V/3A + 5-9V/3A, 27W op),
audio q6asm/tfa987x nodes, 1MiB ramoops @0xbff00000 (ECC), venus enable,
OV8856 camera nodes, pm6150 qgauge batt-id/sram, battery profile
(G7BNVTBM4P 4500mAh, FV 4.4V, conservative FCC 1.5A).
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile             |   1 +
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/pm6150.dtsi          |  24 +-
 .../boot/dts/qcom/sm7150-xiaomi-common.dtsi   |  10 +-
 .../qcom/sm7150-xiaomi-phoenix-battery.dtsi   |  65 ++
 .../boot/dts/qcom/sm7150-xiaomi-phoenix.dts   | 573 ++++++++++++++++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7150.dtsi          |   4 +-
 6 files changed, 662 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7150-xiaomi-phoenix-battery.dtsi
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7150-xiaomi-phoenix.dts

